WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.310 --> 00:00:06.689
Five standard-issue fully loaded FN P90 assault
rifles were prepared for testing with SCP-914.

00:00:06.689 --> 00:00:09.980
The first rifle was placed on the setting
“Fine,” and the resulting output was a

00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:12.330
virtually identical assault rifle.

00:00:12.330 --> 00:00:16.379
The only difference was that it no longer
required any ammunition, but instead fired

00:00:16.379 --> 00:00:19.920
compressed air at 43 billion gigapascals.

00:00:19.920 --> 00:00:24.070
Testing resulted in considerable damage to
the site armory, and experimentation with

00:00:24.070 --> 00:00:27.919
SCP-914 and the rest of the rifles were put
on indefinite hold.

